      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NICISH (2) continues to race well and looks a top chance again. Has had 20 tries here for five wins and 10 minors, including a win two back. Runner-up latest in similar grade and comes back a little in trip this time. Has the claim and looks tough to stop again. MANSIERE (8) is another racing in great heart including a second here last time over 1300m. Honest and should be in the finish again. DIRTY OLD TOWN (4) wasn't far away fresh but will be much better this trip and fitter again. Expecting sharp improvement. HARD PRINCE (5) was fourth here fresh then placed in richer grade on the main track last time. Looks ready to win. METRICAL (3) has been thereabouts lately and will find this easier.",
